Package: dawn-satellite
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPS@, adduser
Recommends: curl, unzip, ca-certificates
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/The-OASIS-Project/dawn
Description: DAWN voice satellite (Tier-1, Raspberry Pi)
 Hands-free voice client for the DAWN assistant: local wake word, VAD, ASR and
 TTS, talking to the DAWN daemon over the DAP2 WebSocket protocol.
 .
 Installs the frozen OTA rollback launcher (/usr/bin/dawn-satellite-launch) and
 the OTA-updatable binary under /var/lib/dawn-satellite. Signed over-the-air
 updates require provisioning an Ed25519 verify key at /etc/dawn/ota_pubkey;
 ML models are fetched separately with dawn-satellite-fetch-models.
